Three exclusions are NON-NEGOTIABLE whatever the table says:

| Exclusion | Rule |
|-----------|------|
| Documentation (`docs/**`) | Owned by a separate doc flow. Refs into docs are checked for resolution only; contents are never read-for-edit and NEVER edited |
| Source code | Read-only evidence facts are verified against - never an edit target, never a place to "fix" a mismatch |
| Secrets | Never read, never opened, and never write a secret VALUE anywhere. Names, paths and ids are fine |

Operational task state (a task board, a tracker dir) is state, not memory: it changes hourly and its owner is named
in `{TRACKER_NOTE}`. Excluded.

