## Safety (baked into every phase)

The Phase-2 HARD constraints (git read-only, secrets, edit surface, no side effects, frontmatter, stable ids,
non-growth) bind the coordinator exactly as a batch agent. One rule lives only here:

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Default branch | DERIVE it: `git symbolic-ref --short refs/remotes/origin/HEAD 2>/dev/null` -> `origin/<name>`, else the bare `{DEFAULT_BRANCH}`; both are valid revisions. Never hardcode `main` |
